{
  "caption": "C. Archived demographic inputs and independently reconstructed mapped-region extents. Input panel size is the archived easySFS dictionary size; contributing SNPs have a positive probability of being polymorphic at the historical chromosome projection. The mapped extent counts unique ACGT reference bases in observed covered regions containing these SNPs. It is a new reconstruction, not automatically the historical input L or a validated callable denominator. No Stairway Plot rerun or recalibration was performed. Matching archived input files does not prove their correspondence to the original production run or plotted histories. The earlier RAD-locus \u00d7150 description should therefore be read in light of these recovered numeric inputs and distinct mapped measurements.",
